                <pb facs="0222" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg142"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-01-07"><hi rendition="#italic">January 7,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that the Chinese court entered the imperial palace at 2
                    o’clock p. m., January 7, and that perfect order prevails.)</p>
            </div>
